          "name": "How much does perforated metal cladding cost in India?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Metaguise installed systems typically range from INR 800 to INR 2,500 per sq ft depending on system and complexity. Pattern, thickness, finish and panel size are the biggest drivers."
