          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is a perforated screen the same as a jaali?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "They serve a similar purpose, but a jaali is a traditional pierced screen, often stone or carved material. A perforated or laser cut metal screen is the modern, more precise version of the same idea."
